   https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/g17-pistol-animated-7723ab14e70446ef8e06a134984f287f
   licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
   (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   Changed for GripLock: the gun alone (the arms and the animation left out),
   placed by its barrel's muzzle, cut into frame, barrel, slide and trigger, its
   pictures halved in size and its normal pictures converted to glTF's
   convention. This licence claims no rights over that material; its own
   licence applies to it.

   The typefaces (Inter, JetBrains Mono and Michroma: SIL Open Font License
   1.1), the 3D library three.js and the video library mp4-muxer (both MIT
   License) are loaded by the page from jsDelivr. They are not part of the app
   and keep their own licences.

